From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: prospero-win <prospero-win@invalid>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:50:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: Trace each process query class once on PS5.

The title's default WINEDEBUG keeps +process for process creation and
exit. NtQueryInformationProcess traced every call, and a game that asks
for ProcessAffinityMask every frame (Call of Juarez Gunslinger, 60 times
a second) filled the title log with that one line, so the +loaddll
lines that place a crash address were gone.

Each class below 128, which covers every class Windows defines, is now
traced the first time it is queried. Wine's own classes above that keep
a line per call; the PS5 clock anchor (ProcessWineQpcAnchor) is queried
only when its anchor runs out.
---
 dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c b/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c
index 7a7b3be..394a46e 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c
@@ -1132,12 +1132,31 @@ static BOOL ps5_is_own_process( HANDLE handle )
 extern NTSTATUS ps5_qpc_anchor( void *args );
 #include "../pw_qpc_clock.h"
 
+#if defined(__PROSPERO__) || defined(__ORBIS__)
+/* Games poll some classes every frame: Call of Juarez Gunslinger asks for
+ * ProcessAffinityMask 60 times a second, and with the title's +process
+ * default that one line filled its whole log, so the +loaddll lines that
+ * place a crash address were gone. Trace each class the first time only. */
+static BOOL first_query( PROCESSINFOCLASS class )
+{
+    static unsigned int queried[4];
+    unsigned int bit;
+
+    if ((unsigned int)class >= 32 * ARRAY_SIZE(queried)) return TRUE;
+    bit = 1u << (class % 32);
+    return !(__atomic_fetch_or( &queried[class / 32], bit, __ATOMIC_RELAXED ) & bit);
+}
+#endif
+
 NTSTATUS WINAPI NtQueryInformationProcess( HANDLE handle, PROCESSINFOCLASS class, void *info,
                                            ULONG size, ULONG *ret_len )
 {
     unsigned int ret = STATUS_SUCCESS;
     ULONG len = 0;
 
+#if defined(__PROSPERO__) || defined(__ORBIS__)
+    if (TRACE_ON(process) && first_query( class ))
+#endif
     TRACE( "(%p,0x%08x,%p,0x%08x,%p)\n", handle, class, info, size, ret_len );
 
     switch (class)
